  ]
 },
 {
  "index": 5,
  "label": "text",
  "content": "Arjun Patel, who has kept bees on the Ayrshire coast for thirty years, came round with a flask of tea and a plain verdict. \"You have put them where you would like to sit,\" he said, \"not where they would like to live.\"",
